{
  "info": {
    "name": "POS Perfume API",
    "description": "Complete test collection for POS Perfume External API v1.\nAll IDs (customer, order, line) are captured dynamically — no hardcoded IDs.\nInfrastructure-optional tests (WhatsApp, PDF, SAP) are skipped gracefully.",
